  },
  "slides": {
    "slide_0": {
      "group": "Verse 1",
      "color": "#2563eb",
      "settings": {
        "color": "",
        "resolution": {
          "width": 1920,
          "height": 1080
        }
      },
      "children": [],
      "notes": "",
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "What a friend we have in Jesus,",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "All our sins and griefs to bear!",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "What a privilege to carry",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Everything to God in prayer!",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "O what peace we often forfeit,",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "O what needless pain we bear,",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "All because we do not carry",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Everything to God in prayer!",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "style": "top:100px;left:100px;height:880px;width:1720px;",
          "align": "align-items:center;"
        }
      ]
    },
    "slide_1": {
      "group": "Verse 2",
      "color": "#2563eb",
      "settings": {
        "color": "",
        "resolution": {
          "width": 1920,
          "height": 1080
        }
      },
      "children": [],
      "notes": "",
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Have we trials and temptations?",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Is there trouble anywhere?",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "We should never be discouraged",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Take it to the Lord in prayer.",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Can we find a friend so faithful",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Who will all our sorrows share?",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Jesus knows our every weakness",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Take it to the Lord in prayer.",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "style": "top:100px;left:100px;height:880px;width:1720px;",
          "align": "align-items:center;"
        }
      ]
    },
    "slide_2": {
      "group": "Verse 3",
      "color": "#2563eb",
      "settings": {
        "color": "",
        "resolution": {
          "width": 1920,
          "height": 1080
        }
      },
      "children": [],
      "notes": "",
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Are we weak and heavy laden,",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Cumbered with a load of care?",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Precious Savior, still our refuge",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Take it to the Lord in prayer.",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Do your friends despise, forsake you?",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Take it to the Lord in prayer.",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "In his arms he'll take and shield you;",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "You will find a solace there.",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "style": "top:100px;left:100px;height:880px;width:1720px;",
          "align": "align-items:center;"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
